          "text": "A place where anyone can thrive GitLab is the trusted enterprise platform for software creation in the AI era, used by more than 100,000 organizations to plan, build, secure, and deploy software at machine scale, guided by humans. Our mission is to unlock every team to ship software at the speed of "
